<BaseLayout title="About DOSU Optical" description="Learn about DOSU Optical, an independent optical practice in Taipan USJ focused on professional eye care and personalised consultation." path="/about"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'About'}]} /><section class="section"><div class="container max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl font-bold">Independent optical care in Subang Jaya</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg">DOSU Optical is an independent optical practice located in Taipan USJ, Subang Jaya.</p><p class="mt-4 text-lg">We believe every patient deserves professional eye care, personalised consultation, and long-term vision solutions instead of simply purchasing a pair of glasses.</p><p class="mt-4 text-lg">Our mission is to provide comprehensive eye examinations, evidence-based recommendations, and quality eyewear for every stage of life.</p><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">{['Mission: accessible professional care','Vision: trusted family eye care authority','Values: clarity, honesty, after-sales care'].map((x)=><div class="card"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">{x}</h2></div>)}</div></div></section></BaseLayout>
